## Problem

A Claude Code session overseeing a Fabrik pipeline learns, through the MCP read tools and pushed events, that an item needs a decision. The decisions it then takes are a small, recurring set:
- promote an item out of Backlog;
- set or clear its autonomy (`fabrik:cruise` / `fabrik:yolo`);
- force a Validate re-run;
- clear an account-wide Claude usage-limit suspension.

Today it does these through `gh`. That spends the budget the daemon shares, needs board and field node IDs, and bypa
